{"format":1,"id":"ruheort","kurz":"ro","sprache":"ar","richtung":"rtl","titel":"مكانٌ هادئ: مَرْجٌ أخضر","untertitel":"رحلةٌ في الخيال إلى مَرْجٍ أخضر، بكلّ الحواسّ.","haltung":["liegen","sitzen_angelehnt"],"augen":"zu_oder_offen","ende":"glocke","schlaf_modus":false,"laengen":{"kurz":{"ziel_s":300},"normal":{"ziel_s":720},"lang":{"ziel_s":1200}},"kb":1105,"abschnitte":[{"id":"ankommen","segmente":[{"id":"s001","art":"sprache","datei":"ro/1.55ae97db.mp3","ms":3175,"text":"استلقِ، أو اجلسْ مستندًا براحة.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s002","art":"sprache","datei":"ro/2.1cec56f8.mp3","ms":5543,"text":"أغمِضْ عينيك إن شئت. ويمكنك أن تفتحهما في أي وقت.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s003","art":"sprache","datei":"ro/3.e726ae5c.mp3","ms":5590,"text":"بعد قليل ستذهب في خيالك إلى مكانٍ هادئ، إلى مَرْجٍ أخضر.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":1,"normal":2,"lang":3}},{"id":"s004","art":"sprache","datei":"ro/4.c8daf50a.mp3","ms":8482,"text":"وإن كنتَ تفضّل مكانًا آخر، كطرف غابة أو شاطئ، فاذهبْ إليه. أنت من يختار.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s005","art":"sprache","datei":"ro/5.71b7c92a.mp3","ms":9309,"text":"دَعْ نَفَسَك يخرج بهدوءٍ وببطء بضع مرّات. ويمكن لتنفّسك أن يتباطأ، من غير ضغط.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s006","art":"sprache","datei":"ro/6.f5a43054.mp3","ms":4165,"text":"ومع كلّ زفير، يصبح جسمك أثقلَ قليلًا.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}}]},{"id":"weg","segmente":[{"id":"s007","art":"sprache","datei":"ro/7.6cf3f20f.mp3","ms":2922,"text":"تخيّلْ أنك تمشي على دربٍ ضيّق.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s008","art":"sprache","datei":"ro/8.f0096957.mp3","ms":2333,"text":"الأرض تحت قدميك ليّنة.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s009","art":"sprache","datei":"ro/9.f3b9bca5.mp3","ms":3263,"text":"وأمامك ينفتح مَرْجٌ أخضرُ واسع.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st01","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":40.8,"normal":62.2,"lang":65.4}},{"id":"s010","art":"sprache","datei":"ro/10.dfa30152.mp3","ms":4575,"text":"الجوّ لطيف. لا هو حارٌّ، ولا هو بارد.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}}]},{"id":"sinne","segmente":[{"id":"s011","art":"sprache","datei":"ro/11.5a536805.mp3","ms":3736,"text":"انظُرْ حولك. العشب أخضرُ ونَضِر.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5.5,"normal":9,"lang":14.5}},{"id":"s012","art":"sprache","datei":"ro/12.6bd63d3f.mp3","ms":5617,"text":"ربما ترى أزهارًا. بيضاء، وصفراء، وبنفسجية.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":9,"lang":14.5}},{"id":"s013","art":"sprache","datei":"ro/13.0545c326.mp3","ms":1984,"text":"فوقك سماءٌ واسعة.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5.5,"normal":9,"lang":14.5}},{"id":"s014","art":"sprache","datei":"ro/14.cac314fc.mp3","ms":2333,"text":"وبعض الغيوم تمرّ ببطء.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":9,"lang":14.5}},{"id":"s015","art":"sprache","datei":"ro/15.0d742274.mp3","ms":2406,"text":"وفي البعيد صفٌّ من الأشجار.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":11}},{"id":"st02","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":62.2,"lang":65.4}},{"id":"s016","art":"sprache","datei":"ro/16.06a171e5.mp3","ms":4348,"text":"أصغِ. ربما تسمع زقزقة العصافير.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5.5,"normal":9,"lang":14.5}},{"id":"s017","art":"sprache","datei":"ro/17.d11e32b8.mp3","ms":2679,"text":"وحفيفَ العشب الخافت مع النسيم.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":9,"lang":14.5}},{"id":"s018","art":"sprache","datei":"ro/18.ebddab68.mp3","ms":5836,"text":"ربما تطنّ نحلةٌ في مكانٍ ما، أو تسمع خريرَ جدولٍ صغير.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":11}},{"id":"s019","art":"sprache","datei":"ro/19.cffa8cad.mp3","ms":5088,"text":"استنشِقِ ا